Blackjack game Requirements 

	1. 	Dealing in correct order - Completed
	2.	.5 to 1 second delay in dealing each card to see order if dealing is correct Completed - Compeleted
	3.	Seven decks - Completed
	4.	Reshuffle when 60-75 cards left - Compeleted
	5.	One, two or three players plus dealer - Completed
	6.	Betting
	7.	Splitting
	8.	Doubling down
	9.	Dealer getting soft 17 - Compeleted

Extras (optional)
	1.	Animate dealing and flipping of cards
	2.	Animate shuffling of cards
	3.	Adding sound effects
	4.	Different looking deck of cards
	5.	Choice of differently looking decks of cards to choose from (in f we can find some)
	6.	Demo of game play to go along with rules